Wait, 210: MSD 2. Others 1, 0. Max is 1. $2 > 1$. Correct.
202: MSD 2. Others 0, 2. Max is 2. $2 \ngtr 2$. Not a Snake number.
So for length $k$, the count is indeed $\sum_{x=1}^9 x^{k-1}$.
