So Alien 2 gives to none.
Alien 3: $A_3 = 9$.
Gives to $k$ where $3 < k \le \min(4, 3+9) = 4$.
So Alien 3 gives to 4.
Alien 4: $A_4 = 3$.
Gives to $k$ where $4 < k \le \min(4, 4+3) = 4$.
None.

